    "title": "One dead after vehicle vs motorcyle wreck on University Drive - NewsBreak",
    "text": "HUNTSVILLE, Ala. (WHNT) — Officials with HEMSI say one person is dead after a wreck involving a vehicle and a motorcycle on University Drive. HEMSI Spokesperson Don Webster said the driver of the motorcycle was pronounced dead after the wreck at 3131 University Drive in Huntsville. He said the wreck happened around 9:46 p.m. A News 19 crew on the scene said HPD had a portion of University Drive blocked off near Julia Street as officers worked to investigate the crash. Webster said the driver of the other vehicle involved was still being evaluated on the scene as of 10:10 p.m. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WHNT.com.",
